<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <p class="section-label">What They Say</p>
      <h2>Loved by <span class="text-pink">Glow Girls</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-grid stagger-children">
      <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
        <div class="testimonial-stars">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"I've never felt this confident wearing a deodorant. Pink Bloom smells amazing and the packaging is SO cute. My new daily essential!"</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar pink-avatar">A</div>
          <div>
            <span class="author-name">Aisyah R.</span>
            <span class="author-detail">Pink Bloom Fan</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card featured-card reveal">
        <div class="testimonial-stars">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"Finally a natural deodorant that actually works! Green Bliss keeps me fresh through my gym sessions. Love that it's free from harsh chemicals too."</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar green-avatar">S</div>
          <div>
            <span class="author-name">Sarah L.</span>
            <span class="author-detail">Green Bliss Lover</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal">
        <div class="testimonial-stars">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#D4A574"><path d="M12 2L15.09 8.26L22 9.27L17 14.14L18.18 21.02L12 17.77L5.82 21.02L7 14.14L2 9.27L8.91 8.26L12 2Z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">"The foam version is a game changer. So smooth, so easy to apply. I bought both scents because I literally can't choose — they're both incredible."</p>
        <div class="testimonial-author">
          <div class="author-avatar pink-avatar">N</div>
          <div>
            <span class="author-name">Nurul H.</span>
            <span class="author-detail">Both Scents Collector</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: var(--pink-light);
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
  }

  .testimonials::before {
    content: '\201C';
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 60px;
    font-family: 'Roca', serif;
    font-size: 18rem;
    color: var(--pink);
    opacity: 0.3;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--pink-dark);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    color: var(--green);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .text-pink { color: var(--pink-dark); }

  .testimonial-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    transition: all 0.4s var(--ease-out-expo);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 198, 208, 0.2);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .testimonial-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(27, 61, 47, 0.06);
  }

  .featured-card {
    background: var(--green);
    border-color: transparent;
  }

  .featured-card .testimonial-text {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  .featured-card .author-name {
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .featured-card .author-detail {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .testimonial-stars {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .testimonial-card .testimonial-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .author-avatar {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .pink-avatar { background: var(--pink-dark); }
  .green-avatar { background: var(--green-light); }

  .featured-card .green-avatar { background: var(--pink); color: var(--green); }

  .author-name {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--green);
  }

  .author-detail {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .testimonial-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .testimonials::before {
      font-size: 12rem;
      right: 20px;
      top: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
